# 승인제: PENDING 상태에서 내 모임(current) 확인 + 신청 취소(=left) + 다시 조회
### 0. 회원가입(HOST_A)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "host_a@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!@#",
  "nickName": "HostA",
  "phoneNumber": "010-1000-0001"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("hostAUserId", response.body.data.userId);
%}

### 0-1. 로그인(HOST_A)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "host_a@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!@#"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("hostAAccessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 1. 모임 V2 이미지 선 업로드 (HOST_A)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v2/groups/images/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary
Authorization: Bearer {{hostAAccessToken}}

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="img1.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../../image/resources/img1.png
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="img2.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../../image/resources/img2.jpg
--boundary--

> {%
  const images = response.body.data.images;
  client.global.set("a_img0_key", images[0].imageKey);
  client.global.set("a_img1_key", images[1].imageKey);
%}

### 2. 승인제 모임 생성 (HOST_A)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v2/groups/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hostAAccessToken}}

{
  "title": "시나리오A 승인제 모임 - PENDING/취소 테스트",
  "joinPolicy": "APPROVAL_REQUIRED",
  "location": "서울 강남구",
  "locationDetail": "강남역 2번출구",
  "startTime": "2026-12-20T19:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-12-20T21:00:00",
  "tags": ["SCENARIO_A", "APPROVAL", "PENDING_CANCEL"],
  "description": "PENDING 상태로 내 모임 조회 후 신청 취소(LEFT/Cancel) 테스트",
  "maxParticipants": 5,
  "images": [
    { "sortOrder": 0, "imageKey": "{{a_img0_key}}" },
    { "sortOrder": 1, "imageKey": "{{a_img1_key}}" }
  ]
}

> {%
  client.global.set("a_groupId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 3. 회원가입(MEMBER_A)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "member_a@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!@#",
  "nickName": "MemberA",
  "phoneNumber": "010-1000-1001"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("memberAUserId", response.body.data.userId);
%}

### 3-1. 로그인(MEMBER_A)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "member_a@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!@#"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("memberAAccessToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 4. MEMBER_A 참여 신청 (승인제 -> PENDING 기대)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v2/groups/{{a_groupId}}/attend
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAAccessToken}}

{}

### 5. 내 모임 조회 (MEMBER_A) - current 기본
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v2/groups/me?size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAAccessToken}}

> {%
  const nextCursor = response.body.data.nextCursor;
  if (nextCursor !== null && nextCursor !== undefined) {
    client.global.set("a_cursor_current_1", nextCursor);
  }
%}

### 6. 내 모임 조회 (MEMBER_A) - current + myStatuses=PENDING
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v2/groups/me?type=current&size=10&myStatuses=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAAccessToken}}

### 7. MEMBER_A 신청 취소/나가기 (PENDING -> LEFT 또는 CANCEL 처리 기대)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v2/groups/{{a_groupId}}/left
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAAccessToken}}

{}

### 8. 내 모임 조회 (MEMBER_A) - current 재조회 (PENDING 없어졌는지 확인)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v2/groups/me?type=current&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAAccessToken}}

### 8.1 내 모임 조회 (MEMBER_A) - current + myStatuses=CANCELLED
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v2/groups/me?type=current&size=10&myStatuses=CANCELLED
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAAccessToken}}

### 9. (선택) 모임 상세 조회 - MEMBER_A 상태 확인
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v2/groups/{{a_groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{memberAAccessToken}}

